WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.861 --> 00:00:09.649
Hi! I'm Ana.

00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:11.628
Welcome to 'What to Say!'

00:00:32.412 --> 00:00:35.562
Do you know what to say when you meet new people?

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:39.069
Listen out for useful language for meeting new people.

00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:42.621
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases –

00:00:43.024 --> 00:00:44.444
