00:00:59.132 --> 00:00:59.731
Hi.

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:00.317
Hello.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:01.523
Are you Paul?

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:02.491
No, I'm not.

00:01:02.622 --> 00:01:04.488
But he asked me to meet you.

00:01:04.783 --> 00:01:05.783
I'm Emir.

00:01:05.838 --> 00:01:07.038
You must be Vanya.

00:01:07.309 --> 00:01:08.309
Yes, I am.

00:01:08.637 --> 00:01:09.771
Nice to meet you.

00:01:09.894 --> 00:01:10.655
You too.

00:01:11.076 --> 00:01:12.630
Can I show you the office?

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:13.451
Perfect.

00:01:13.464 --> 00:01:14.464
Thanks.

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:16.276
So how was your journey?

00:01:16.849 --> 00:01:17.887
It was fine

00:01:18.009 --> 00:01:19.506
and it's great to be here!

00:01:19.583 --> 00:01:21.480
Well, it's great to have you here.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.467
Can I get you a coffee?

00:01:23.657 --> 00:01:24.985
Oh, yes, please.

00:01:25.453 --> 00:01:26.392
Ah, Yuna,

00:01:26.469 --> 00:01:27.496
this is Vanya.

00:01:27.674 --> 00:01:30.442
Oh, hi, I'm Yuna. Nice to meet you.

00:01:30.665 --> 00:01:31.998
Welcome to the team!

00:01:33.555 --> 00:01:34.555
Hello again!

00:01:34.779 --> 00:01:35.951
That went well.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.383
OK,

00:01:37.448 --> 00:01:41.582
